\ query.fam — the state read for the API (docs/NODE.md, step 8), after
\ connect.fam.  Each word runs in a transaction the caller opened (stx).
\
\ yoproof ( lo hi c -- )  c (40 digests, canonical words) = the path of
\ the output at position lo hi (below 2^40) to the state root, its leaf's
\ sibling first and the names trie's root last (tabminer's UtxoSet::prove,
\ state_tree::Proof): the group's 256 leaves made again from its outputs,
\ the levels above from the stored nodes.
\ ynproof ( key c -- depth tag )  c = the siblings (canonical) from the
\ key's terminal up to the trie's root (NameTrie::prove); the terminal in
\ yterm as tget leaves a node (tag 1 a leaf: its key, value, hash; -1 an
\ empty slot).
\ ykey ( name len k -- )  k (4 words) = a name's key.
\ ybody ( h -- a n | 0 0 )  block h's body, if kept (malloc'd).
\ yfind ( id -- e | 0 )  the header with that id (8 canonical words):
\ held (hfind), or the store's by its index ('i'), if the header at that
\ height has that id; in a transaction of its own, as yentry.
\ yentry ( h -- e | 0 )  main-chain header h from the store, as a header
\ entry (the header, its id at CC, its work at EC: headers.fam's), in a
\ buffer of its own, for heights below those held (hbase); in a
\ transaction of its own (stx kept for whatever the caller holds).

: yc variable ;  : ylo variable ;  : yhi variable ;  : yix variable ;  : ylv variable ;  : ytmp variable ;
: yk variable ;  : ykp variable ;  : ydep variable ;  : ytag variable ;  : yterm variable ;  : yhb variable ;

\ ycanon ( m c -- )  8 Montgomery words at m as canonical words at c.
: ycanon  8 lit 0 lit do over i w@ fromm over i w! loop 2drop ;

\ ypidx ( level -- index )  the position's node at a level.
: ypidx  dup 20 lit u< if ylo @ over rshift  yhi @ rot 20 lit swap - lshift or else yhi @ swap 20 lit - rshift then ;

: yoproof  ( lo hi c -- )
yc ! yhi ! ylo !
ylv @ 800 lit wzero
100 lit 0 lit do
	ylo @ FFFFFF00 lit and i or  yhi @ oget if sbuf @ ylv @ i 5 lit lshift + rleaf then
loop
ylo @ FF lit and yix !
8 lit 0 lit do
	ylv @ yix @ 1 lit xor 5 lit lshift + yc @ i 5 lit lshift + ycanon
	100 lit i 1 lit + rshift 0 lit do  ylv @ i 6 lit lshift +  dup 20 lit + ylv @ i 5 lit lshift + compress  loop
	yix @ 1 lit rshift yix !
loop
27 lit 8 lit do
	i ypidx 1 lit xor  i swap ytmp @ nget
	ytmp @ yc @ i 5 lit lshift + ycanon
loop
ytmp @ troot  ytmp @ yc @ 4E0 lit + ycanon ;

: ynproof  ( key c -- depth tag )
yc ! yk !
yk @ twalk ytag ! ydep !  tnb @ yterm @ 15 lit wcopy
ydep @ ?dup if 0 lit do
	ydep @ i -
	yk @ over ykp @ kprefix  ykp @ 78 lit 2 lit pick - kxbit
	ykp @ ytmp @ tchild
	ytmp @ yc @ i 5 lit lshift + ycanon
loop then
ydep @ ytag @ ;

: ykey  ( name len k -- )  -rot ytmp @ nhash  ytmp @ swap keyof ;

\ (ylite: the body kept is a lite block's, without its proof: the top
\ bit of its length)
: ylite variable ;
: ybody  ( h -- a n | 0 0 )
dup FFFF lit kbody sbuf @ 4 lit sget 4 lit = if
	sbuf @ @ dup 0< ylite !  7FFFFFFF lit and  dup malloc  ( h n a )
	\ (no room for it: as one not kept)
	dup if
		over 3FF lit + A lit rshift 0 lit do
			2 lit pick i kbody  over i A lit lshift + 400 lit sget drop
		loop
		rot drop swap
	else drop 2drop 0 lit 0 lit then
else drop 0 lit 0 lit then ;

: yinit  2000 lit alloc ylv !  20 lit alloc ytmp !  10 lit alloc ykp !  54 lit alloc yterm !  20 lit alloc yhb ! ;

: yent variable ;  : ystx variable ;
: yentry
yent @ 0= if 120 lit alloc yent ! then
stx @ ystx !  stfd @ 0 lit txbegin stx !
dup khdr yent @ CC lit sget CC lit = if
	yent @ EC lit + 8 lit wzero  kwork yent @ EC lit + 20 lit sget drop
	yent @ yent @ CC lit + blockid  yent @ CC lit + dfrom  yent @
else drop 0 lit then
stx @ txcommit drop  ystx @ stx ! ;

: yfid variable ;
: yfind
dup hfind dup 0< 0= if nip he else drop
	yfid !
	stx @ ystx !  stfd @ 0 lit txbegin stx !
	yfid @ kid sbuf @ 4 lit sget 4 lit = if sbuf @ @ else FFFFFFFF lit then
	stx @ txcommit drop  ystx @ stx !
	dup 0< if drop 0 lit else
		yentry dup if dup CC lit + yfid @ 8 lit wcmp if drop 0 lit then then
	then
then ;
